{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25938","headline":"蔡平喜遇河阳马判官宽话别 · 鲍溶","name":"蔡平喜遇河阳马判官宽话别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"从事东军正四年，相逢且喜偃兵前。\n看寻狡兔翻三窟，见射妖星落九天。\n江上柳营回鼓角，河阳花府望神仙。\n秋风萧飒醉中别，白马嘶霜鴈叫烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25938.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25938","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}